mimalloc (Linux musl release builds, MIT)
----------------------------------------
Pinned source: https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc/tree/b18ab4eef383f655e760881b02eff8af02800879
The C allocation ABI is statically overridden; a marked build-tree source copy
disables mimalloc's optional C++ aliases so lmnum retains its own counted
C++ new/delete operators. macOS and Windows do not link this allocator.

